Alembic migration environment.

Config only at this stage — no migration scripts yet. Generated revisions
land in `versions/`. The database URL is resolved at runtime in `env.py`
from application settings (DATABASE_URL), not hardcoded in alembic.ini.

Create a migration once ORM models exist:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create <table>"
Apply migrations:
    alembic upgrade head
